351457580_7733951258780345522_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s7LYnKEbzq0Q7kNvwE5Rcec&_nc_oc=AdplBt4UCk9ko5D_lC2UDPZOgVRzpFLaNCOB7Lgp0hi182BrBSPWWcUtqzrTSc0IE_A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af14n7MO7j9rBdusRfHyHv-kKjwnR5uJf50Akdloe2ZT9A&oe=69F217C9"}, {"file_name": "logo (2.0).png", "id": "481377393480829", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035322_481377396814162_4002553311224301807_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ucQFSJr80aYQ7kNvwErHpMY&_nc_oc=AdpYll8GTTBpYnvgkr8k8EAT4m5NrjaYjr5h2RvUTr7jfIU7bCrj-LMYteMbuO-YAiU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0zhMEWQnP53QZS4IoKGpg6cdsYFax_jQgQ2z4imL2nOg&oe=69F2190C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dark Den", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HUSTLE, COMBAT, RELEASE. Dark Den: is Single Player, ARPG (Action Role Play Game), full of adventure, only possible in VR\n\nWelcome to Dark Den: where you must fight and survive until the end to save and release your friends. The Den is full of wicked and powerful enemies, it will take courage, strength and surviving instincts to defeat them.\n\nDARK DEN: delivers an unparallel experience with its unique environment. Experience the THRILL - Fall, Climb, Run, Jump, Trek, Dodge the snakes, take the ladders, fight the enemy, find your friends and bring them home. Collect the MYSTERY BOXES on the Board. UNLEASH THE BEAST. Use the weapons to FIGHT and win levels. ", "short_description": "HUSTLE, COMBAT, RELEASE. Dark Den: is Single Player, ARPG (Action Role Play Game), full of adventure, only possible in VR.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.darkdengame.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pastelcube Technologies Private Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.znanye.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED"